..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : PRODLIST.ARCHIVE
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich :teamreport
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Functionality  : Defines parameters to create an document using mask context.
.. xbeauf   = workorder defined in header field kba or in table field banummer
..            the future process document record is linked to
.. ATTENTION: This program must not call fo command .end. Each error handling
..            must take place outside this fop. Example see ev/VORGANG.SPERR
.. Includes       :
.. include fe/WORKORDER.COMMON.ARCHIVE
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.type P9:1 xbeauf ? _F|defined(U|xbeauf)
..
.continue HEADER ? F|empty(M|aktzeile)
..
.. Workoder is defined in table field of the infosystem
.select screen line 'M|aktzeile'
.continue END ? _F|defined(M|order)
.assign U|xbeauf = M|order
.continue COMMON
..
!HEADER: Workoder is defined in header field of the infosystem
.continue END ? _F|defined(M|kba)
.assign U|xbeauf = M|kba
..
!COMMON
.input "fe/WORKORDER.COMMON.ARCHIVE"
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
